be.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.130
This just rarely happens.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:01.029
I mean, that's the reality, Trump is accused
of dozens of sexual assaults.

00:11:01.029 --> 00:11:03.009
He said he grabs them by the You-Know-What.

00:11:03.009 --> 00:11:05.040
He became president of the United States.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:11.279
Louis C.K., after having an incident of I
believe it was masturbating in front of someone,

