00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:28.991
If cancer culture were really so pervasive
and so endemic to the modern mill, you, so

00:11:28.991 --> 00:11:34.709
to speak, you would have way more people whose
careers have been ruined by people tweeting

00:11:34.709 --> 00:11:37.820
about them or calling their employer or whatever
the case may be.

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:42.579
Now, I know some of you will say, yeah, but
David, what about, you know, some someone

00:11:42.579 --> 00:11:44.009
I've never heard of?

00:11:44.009 --> 00:11:47.750
I don't deny that in a country of 330 million
people.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:52.750
You are going to have examples of everything
when we point out.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.500
Look at all these guns that are being misused.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:12:01.170
The gun crowd says, well, when I am banned
guns or really do much of anything because

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:06.040
of these few isolated incidents, we have the
Second Amendment in this country.

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:11.750
Well, likewise, just because you can find
someone who was unfairly damaged by a social

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:17.600
media shaming campaign or whatever, I may
well be on your side on individual instances

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:18.620
