00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:21.230
But we have this thing called free speech.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:25.420
Boycotts are a part of of liberal democracies.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.930
And they have been for a very long time.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.649
And there is no rash of every.

00:12:30.649 --> 00:12:35.399
Tons of people having their careers ruined
because of some off color comment they made

00:12:35.399 --> 00:12:37.790
decades and decades ago or even more recently.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:38.990
You can find examples.

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:43.250
But if this were actually pervasive, the way
